# Client deployments — opaque working dirs, NOT part of the public marketing surface.
# Each client's actual deployment (real .env, real domain, real DB credentials) lives here
# but is intentionally not tracked. Reconstruct from core/ recipes + the client's backup.
client-stacks/

# Secrets — every tool under core/ has its own .env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.secrets
secrets/

